WEBVTT

00:06:59.079 --> 00:07:03.288
I feel like the obsession with employee
engagement has really missed the mark.

00:07:03.538 --> 00:07:05.913
I don't go to work hoping that I'm
going to be engaged today.

00:07:06.663 --> 00:07:10.954
I hope that I'm going to have motivation
and meaning and that I'm going to have

00:07:10.954 --> 00:07:14.538
a sense of well-being. And I wonder
if if one of the effects that

00:07:14.538 --> 00:07:16.496
the pandemic has had on
a lot of people and

00:07:16.496 --> 00:07:19.954
a lot of leaders in workplaces is to
get them to recognize, you know,

00:07:19.954 --> 00:07:22.454
what we need to care about people's
well-being in their lives,

00:07:22.454 --> 00:07:24.663
not just their engagement at work. Well.

00:07:27.496 --> 00:07:31.371
I thought that, you know, I'm not an
expert. This is your field, not mine.